Package: quick-rec
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: ffmpeg, xclip, slop, python3, python3-gi, python3-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-pangocairo-1.0
Maintainer: Hao <hao@local>
Description: Quick Screen Region Recorder for Linux
 Lightweight screen region recorder using ffmpeg, slop, and GTK overlay.
 Toggle via hotkey Super+Shift+R or app menu, copies video path to clipboard on stop.
